    "original_description": "CELDYQUE 9-Peptide Scalp Care Serum Roll-On targets the scalp with Rosemary 2%, Caffeine 1%, PDRN, Spicule 300, Dexpanthenol, Biotin, Zinc PCA and a peptide complex for lightweight daily root-focused care.",
    "original_ingredient_text": "Key Ingredients Rosemary · Caffeine · PDRN · Peptides Roll-OnNo RinseNon-GreasyDaily Scalp Care Key Ingredients: Rosemary Extract, Caffeine, Dexpanthenol, Sodium DNA (PDRN), Hydrolyzed Sponge / Spicule 300, Biotin, Zinc PCA and a 9-peptide complex. Benefits: Scalp care, root nourishment, hair-density support appearance and scalp purifying care. Formula: Lightweight water-base gel. Non-greasy. No rinse needed. Refer to the product packaging for the complete and most current ingredient list. For external use only. Avoid direct contact with the eyes. Perform a patch test before first use. Discontinue use if persistent irritation occurs. Keep out of reach of children.",
